Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:08.40,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,200,,從前有一個得到一切的男人，\N傳說中的海賊王哥爾·D·羅傑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.92,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,他臨刑前的最後遺言，驅使人們航向大海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.70,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,All my wealth and treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.27,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,It can be yours if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.46,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,Search for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.81,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,I left everything in that one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:22.82,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,人們為了追尋夢想而出航。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.43,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,世界迎來了大海賊時代！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:55.81,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你說你要保護所有人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:57.36,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,別讓我笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:01.03,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你還真敢說大話啊，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:10.77,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,可惡的乘地，他連乘肯都要攻擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:13.30,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,快逃吧，白星公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:16.07,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,盡可能把諾亞引離島的遠方！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:21.33,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,已經太遲了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:32.38,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,太遲了？他在說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.96,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,等等...他不是剛把乘肯打倒了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:41.38,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,如果乘肯在諾亞裡面死亡或失去意識的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:02.74,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,...那他的能力就會在魚人島正上方停止作用。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.20,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,諾亞...會墜落...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:10.09,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,直接砸到島上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.23,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,你在幹啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.67,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,好痛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你這該死的饅頭混帳。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.14,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}饅頭：一種圓滾滾的日本糕點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.55,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,用墜落的衝擊波\N把娜美桑震倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:29.98,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,給我加倍奉還！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:35.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這是報復...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.03,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你剛才那道衝擊波撞到娜美桑的報復！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.12,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}小心衝擊波，娜美桑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:56.52,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,又有衝擊波？饒了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.47,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不要大意！小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:01.64,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,她剛才從天候棒裡射出了什麼東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:11.49,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,她是女巫嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:15.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,太沒禮貌了！我才不是女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:19.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,叫我女魔法師吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:28.87,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,雖然嚴格說來不是魔法，只是經過計算的科學。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:33.67,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,雲、雲？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:35.87,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}雷雲之杖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:48.43,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,{\i1}好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:50.17,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.02,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,不要過來-嗨！我會變成烤魷魚的-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.06,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,是那個女人害的嗎-嗨？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.86,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,喂，伊卡洛斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:06:03.12,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,那個穿黑色西裝的男人\N一以為她受傷了就很擔心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:08.04,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,她極有可能是草帽海賊團的弱點。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.02,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.41,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,我去把她按住。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.25,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,趁那時候，用你的長矛給她最後一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.08,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,收到-呣嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:18.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你現在最好別惹我，\N否則我就把你烤焦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！我的腿動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.73,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,我要把你做成烤魷魚-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.12,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等、等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:39.69,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,為什麼我的腳動不了？！有誰來幫忙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:45.03,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,娜美桑！啊，對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:48.70,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,吃我這招！炸魷魚長矛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.12,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,能讓我看看你的胖{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.54,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,這是你的同伴嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.09,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,他要被吸乾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:03.63,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,變成烤魷魚吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:04.95,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不好意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:07.64,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,怎麼回事-嗨？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:11.14,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,我的長矛會吸乾你身體裡的水分，\N把你變成乾貨-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.89,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,喂，乾魷魚長矛！為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:20.23,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,怎麼了？！\N為什麼？！為什麼？！為什麼？！為什麼？！為什麼？！為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:21.30,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:25.81,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我很久以前就已經乾掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.95,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:36.92,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！這裡有沒有值得一打的對手啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.67,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.16,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,你是誰-嗨？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:51.71,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,是我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.09,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,說是我也沒用-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.21,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？！你認不出這個超級機器人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:59.59,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯？仔細一看，\N你是其中一個幹部吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:03.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你一定有骨氣吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:06.35,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,我雖然是烏賊，但也是魚人！\N我當然有脊椎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:10.02,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,什麼？你是烏賊卻有脊椎骨？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.63,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\i1}同情！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:13.03,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他不是字面上的意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:17.26,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，骷髏。你先讓開一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:19.59,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,什麼？為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:21.33,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你的腳！你的腳！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.77,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我的腳怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你踩在他身上了！就踩在他身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.53,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,哈？！這傢伙是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:32.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,就是他讓我動不了的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:35.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個...請問您是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:41.67,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}感覺如何？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:42.72,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:46.45,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,被我的頭撞腳底的威力嚇到了嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:50.02,Main,Absolutely everyone in the area,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:55.60,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,我的攻擊會慢慢開始生效的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:56.94,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.84,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他死也不承認自己被踩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.27,0:09:01.53,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,對不起，踩到你的臉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:03.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,別說啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.54,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,我這招的名字叫做...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:08.62,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,超足裏頭突！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:12.57,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,超級腳底頭槌！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}他還給它取了名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.93,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了，你這該死的珊瑚頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.02,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我要把你咬碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:27.84,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,在地底下我絕對不會輸！我想去哪就去哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:29.37,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,達摩桑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:34.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不要在地底挖太多洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們會卡住的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喬巴！你弄好了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:49.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,從這邊出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.33,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,蠢蛋！他大意了-哆鈎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:55.62,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,我要壓扁他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:10:00.59,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,被壓扁然後去死吧-咚感！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.85,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布，趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.02,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}角砲·十一連射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:12.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幹得好，喬巴！你把地道連起來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:13.99,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,嗯，弄好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:16.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好！來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:29.65,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}骸骨爆炸草
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,嚐到我厲害了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:42.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)}我們在阿拉巴斯坦對付過挖洞的敵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:47.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是經驗讓我們贏了這場仗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:47.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.86,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,可惡，你這珊瑚怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.02,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,是你幹的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:57.07,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,讓你見識一下我恐怖的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,說到力量，我可是留了一手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.29,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我要把那鼻子咬碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:07.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,來試試看啊！喬巴，掩護我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂、喂，我需要支援啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喬巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.48,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,救救我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.56,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,你們還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.07,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,我馬上幫你們治療傷口。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.07,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,老公！撐住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:53.47,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.47,0:11:55.50,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,快幫他們治療！快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:12:00.37,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,可惡的乘地。\N他連手無寸鐵的市民都不放過！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:04.77,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,公主...沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:06.26,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:08.61,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,但我相信...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:11.14,Main,Villager,0,0,0,,她一定還在為我們戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:15.77,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,夏莉夫人。\N魚人島會怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.64,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,真的會被毀滅嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.53,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,我必須把它帶走。帶到遠處去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:44.03,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你還真是拚命啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:47.06,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,離開島...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.86,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:51.72,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:54.98,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,如果諾亞落下來就完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.70,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,不好了！她聽不到我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.62,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,你不能直接往上游！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:06.36,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,往旁邊！往旁邊游！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.91,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,他們發現了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:11.43,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.05,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:19.63,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,龍星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:23.41,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,不要妨礙我的計畫！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:26.01,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,哥哥！撐住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:31.64,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,如果乘肯的能力不在這裡停止，那殺他還有什麼意義？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:33.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,原來如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:39.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果我們不動的話，船就會墜毀在魚人島上，那裡的所有人都會死！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:44.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,弱星公主那麼辛苦才把它引離島的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:47.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,星哥哥！我們去弱星那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.41,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.06,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:53.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}弱星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:59.74,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我不會讓你們走的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:03.70,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,魚人島會被壓碎，連同島上所有的人一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:09.92,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽，你的同伴也必死無疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:11.95,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.58,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.20,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}往旁邊游！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.51,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:35.69,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:38.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,弱星！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:40.82,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,該死的人魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:42.90,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,太無禮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.97,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,白星聽到我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:46.45,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,她往旁邊游了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.03,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你不該那樣做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.07,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我不會讓你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.93,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:14:59.71,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.26,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不會放手的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.13,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,可惡...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:10.93,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,諾亞！往這邊來！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我快抓不住了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.94,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,諾亞！跟著我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:20.77,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:21.93,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:24.90,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,可惡的乘肯！你快點去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:29.70,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,可惡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:34.54,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,那混帳乘地，我不會放過他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:44.86,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,諾亞！我在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:50.59,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,船...它開始往旁邊移動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.23,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}太好了！繼續加油，弱星！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.64,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:55.64,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:03.24,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,我左手的目標...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:07.17,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,乘地，就是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:09.41,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,給我記住！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:12.11,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,直到你死...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:16.08,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,無論你的身體還是靈魂，我都會一直追殺你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.62,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:22.71,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,白星！再一點點就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.71,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,如果偏太遠的話，這一切就沒有意義了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:30.30,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,直到地獄的盡頭我都會追殺你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:57.06,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,諾亞...正在墜落！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.69,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,趕上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:12.81,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,魚人島...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:15.21,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,還是有危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:17.66,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:20.83,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,{\i1}勝利是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.25,0:35:15.59,Note,Luffy,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}武裝色·硬化
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.42,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,他總算死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:10.63,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,現在班德·乘肯的能力會停止，\N諾亞就會直接墜落在魚人島上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:13.47,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,去死吧！草帽海賊團！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.62,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你們這群蠢蛋妨礙了我的復仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.48,Main,Ryuuboshi,0,0,0,,魚人島要...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:19.70,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,...被毀滅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:26.00,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，我們必須阻止那艘船。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:28.75,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.13,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你想阻止諾亞，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:33.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個混帳。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:37.88,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,如果諾亞撞上魚人島，\N那就一切都完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:42.97,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們的王國和守護諾亞\N長達數百年的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:46.04,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,聽好了，我的兒子們。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:51.45,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,那艘方舟諾亞，不只是一個歷史遺跡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:19:02.95,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，幾百年前，\N我們與一位非常重要的人交換了承諾。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:07.90,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,那艘船一直在海底耐心等待著，\N為了實現那個承諾。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:11.50,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,那艘船還沒有完成它的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:16.43,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,而且現在，連建造那艘船的技術\N都已經失傳了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:20.85,Flashbacks,Neptune,0,0,0,,在約定之日到來之前，\N絕對不能讓諾亞有任何一道傷痕！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:23.12,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們明白了，父王。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:28.10,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們會查明它移動的原因\N並做出適當的處置。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:32.81,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,無論付出什麼代價，\N我們都要拯救王國和諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:37.79,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽，你說要保護所有人\N只是在說大話嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:39.13,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我會阻止它的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:42.97,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要在它砸到島上之前，把那艘船砸個粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.23,0:19:44.95,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你不要說那種話！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:51.88,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,就算你做得到，我已經說過了，諾亞承載著我們的過去和未來。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:55.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那有沒有其他方法可以拯救這座島？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.13,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們沒時間想了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.95,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,還能怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:02.09,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘肯可能還活著。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:07.04,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,如果把他叫醒的話，\N說不定能讓他改變船的航向！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:10.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這麼說，但如果他已經死了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:11.92,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果我們不趕快把船毀掉的話{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:14.55,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我說了不要說那種話！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:16.56,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你們倆要開打嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:19.36,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,看看你們倆在吵架的時候，發生了什麼事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:21.76,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,諾亞快要撞上魚人島了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:27.79,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,請等一下，諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.28,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,島上有很多我很珍惜的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:33.09,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,乘肯大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:37.07,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,如果你還活著，那就拜託把船瞄準我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:40.16,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,請放過魚人島上所有人的性命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:45.58,Main,Manboshi,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.34,Note,Hody,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}海太鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:54.12,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,親愛的曼星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:55.39,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,曼星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:00.49,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,接下來輪到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,乘地！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.47,0:21:05.15,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.41,0:21:12.83,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,魯夫大人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:23.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:26.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我的武裝色對鈍擊很有效，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,但對這種攻擊沒有用。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:30.27,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我的霸氣還需要鍛鍊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:38.81,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們沒有時間在水中戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:41.75,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果要揍他，我們必須換地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:52.08,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,也就是說，你想在這艘正在墜落的船上戰鬥？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:55.13,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,但你真正想要的一定是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.49,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,船上的空氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:04.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要我能登上船，\N就能一拳解決那個混帳乘地！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.23,0:22:08.17,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我就擔心他會這麼做！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.17,0:22:11.87,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,泡泡只要被撕開一個夠大的洞\N就會破裂的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:20.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡，甲板上已經沒有空氣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:38.67,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你現在應該明白了吧，在這種情況下無能為力的人類，確實是不如魚人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.09,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你根本沒有餘力去想阻止諾亞的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:43.51,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你連我都打不過！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:45.67,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,去死吧，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.62,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.62,0:22:49.92,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,魯夫大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.60,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,非常抱歉，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:52.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,弱星？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:57.04,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,是福卡博西哥哥叫我這麼做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:22:58.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,星哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.25,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘地！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:02.36,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你到底想幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:05.46,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你不知道島上有多少條人命嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:08.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,星哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.04,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,親愛的福卡博西。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.96,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,雖然你只有假的力量，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:16.97,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我無法對抗你這件事\N代表我還太嫩了。我承認。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.97,0:23:20.14,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,但希望還在！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:33.98,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘地，為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:38.19,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你為什麼要殺害這麼多無辜的同胞？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:41.10,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你的目的到底是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:47.69,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,是什麼驅使你做出這麼可怕的事，乘地？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.19,0:23:51.20,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,去死！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.41,0:23:58.98,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,親愛的福卡博西！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.21,0:24:09.05,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,光靠那種假力量是打不倒我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:12.48,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你居然還活著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:16.17,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘地，你到底想幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:21.86,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你說要向人類復仇，\N但你卻在攻擊魚人。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:27.57,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你難道不知道魚人島上有多少你的魚人同胞會因此喪命嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:32.01,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你甚至要殺掉\N你在魚人街一起長大的兒時同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.90,0:24:37.97,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你知道你在做什麼嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:51.02,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你對人類是恨到喪失理智了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:54.74,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你到底遭遇了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:58.25,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你被人類虐待過嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.25,0:25:03.69,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,人類殺了你心愛的人\N還是你珍貴的朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.69,0:25:07.94,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼事才讓你變成這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:09.69,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,回答我，乘地！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.69,0:25:13.38,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,人類到底對你做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:49.94,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,親愛的福卡博西！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:52.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,弱星...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.99,0:25:59.56,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:00.83,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,這裡是空氣罐。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:02.32,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,我是之前見過面的那個人。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:05.71,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們已經收到關於這個嚴峻情勢的說明了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.71,0:26:09.21,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們的偵測器已偵測到正在墜落的諾亞。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.08,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,準備工作正按計畫進行。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:14.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,原來這就是星哥哥之前說的。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:17.34,Flashbacks,Hody,0,0,0,,你想上甲板嗎？\N那我先到那裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:18.64,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘地！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.13,0:26:20.77,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,追上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:23.08,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,不，等一下，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.08,0:26:25.38,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,為什麼要等啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.38,0:26:28.22,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,你應該已經學到教訓了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.22,0:26:33.14,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,在水中戰鬥\N對乘地這樣的魚人壓倒性有利。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.14,0:26:34.26,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,如果繼續下去的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.26,0:26:36.16,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,那要怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.16,0:26:37.43,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我有計畫了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:42.16,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！你要去哪，星哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.55,0:26:47.12,Flashbacks,Soldier,0,0,0,,福卡博西王子。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:48.91,Flashbacks,Soldier,0,0,0,,王子發生了什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.91,0:26:54.87,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們可能很快就需要大量空氣。\N立刻準備好。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:55.68,Flashbacks,Soldiers,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.25,0:27:00.12,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒關係的。甲板上不是有空氣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.12,0:27:02.10,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,我在那邊打倒他就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.10,0:27:09.33,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,先不談乘肯的問題，\N你覺得乘地會按照你的條件來打嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.33,0:27:14.32,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,帶上這隻幼年電話蟲，\N以防萬一。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.32,0:27:17.23,Flashbacks,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,小心行動。我們出發了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.29,0:27:23.42,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,魯夫大人，您打算怎麼處理諾亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:25.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！你在嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.51,0:27:27.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你要怎麼把空氣給我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:30.65,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們會用掉空氣罐裡所有的空氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.65,0:27:33.11,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,空氣罐？那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.11,0:27:36.98,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,那是一種輸送空氣的裝置，\N用來運送空氣到魚人島。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.98,0:27:41.72,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,如果我們用空氣罐的空氣製造一個泡泡，\N應該可以把諾亞整艘包住。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.17,0:27:49.10,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,但泡泡會失去浮力，\N所以空氣不會讓諾亞浮起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.88,0:27:52.49,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,也就是說，它無法阻止諾亞的墜落。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.49,0:27:58.27,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,而且要造出大到能包住諾亞的泡泡，\N我們必須用掉所有的空氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:28:01.06,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,所以我們只有一次機會。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.06,0:28:05.75,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,在諾亞正好經過我們旁邊的那一瞬間，如果錯過的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.75,0:28:09.08,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,就沒有第二次機會了。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,雖然我沒聽懂全部...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:12.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,但基本上就是孤注一擲？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.18,0:28:18.10,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,是的。希望我們能做得更多，\N但我們能做的就是把一切託付給你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:20.48,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,讓你承受這樣的重擔，我們真的非常抱歉{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:23.31,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不要跟我說有多困難！\N趕快把空氣給我就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:25.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要有空氣，我會想辦法的！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:26.89,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:29.35,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們會傾盡全力幫助你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.35,0:28:32.26,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,魯夫先生，魚人島就拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.26,0:28:35.09,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽。白星。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.09,0:28:37.77,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你以為跟著諾亞一起墜落能做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.77,0:28:40.72,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,這正是人類和人魚公主才幹得出的蠢事！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.23,0:28:46.32,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.54,0:28:49.33,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這混帳！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.51,0:29:20.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他不死心！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:28.80,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,喂，人類。放棄吧，人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:33.01,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,光看著你就讓我渾身不舒服。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.53,0:29:36.22,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,就算要縮短我的壽命...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:38.68,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,不管傷害多少無辜的旁觀者...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:44.53,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我一定要向你們人類報仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.53,0:29:45.91,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個乘地。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.79,0:30:01.08,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,你絕對不能失手。我們只有一次機會。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.08,0:30:03.38,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,如果失手的話，魚人島就...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:12.29,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,喂，草帽。聽得到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.29,0:30:14.15,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,是福卡博西的聲音！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:16.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,星哥哥，你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:22.84,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,僥倖活了下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.84,0:30:25.23,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,但更重要的是，仔細聽好。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.73,0:30:30.56,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,乘地·乘斯...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.51,0:30:37.42,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我理解他了。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

